+### 1.3 What it compares against
+
+Nothing on the handler.
+- There is no `fSecurity`, no password book, no LevelSet, no `AccessLevel`.
+- The typed strings go to the host:
+  - SV 37008 `"Enter Barcode Reader"` reads `&asSecsGemBarCode` (uHGemHT9045_SV.cpp:696).
+  - SV 37012 `"Enter Barcode Reader Password"` reads `&asSecsGemBarCodePasswoed` (:699).
+  - CEID: `BarcodeReaderEnter, //70 Barcode Reader Enter` (uHGemHT9045.h:86); `EventDescription[SECS_EVENT.BarcodeReaderEnter] ="70 Barcode Reader Enter";` (uHGemHT9045.cpp:141).
