+## 3. St01's D-026 mechanism, and whether this box can reuse it
+
+**Flow (alarm note):**
+1. Arm. `tools/wb_serve.cpp:445` calls `W906_NoteAuthArm(qid, code, kcode, motorNote)` (WebLogin.cpp:2416-2455), which runs golden `TfNote::FormShow`'s password block once per note (`requestId`).
+2. Tell the page. `tools/wb_serve.cpp:377` / `:381` puts an `"auth"` object into Alarm-dialog-request (`W906_NoteAuthRequestJson`, WebLogin.cpp:2457-2507; `tools/wb_dialog_mailbox.h:576` `AlarmRequestJson`). It holds no secret:
+   `{"required":true,"kind":"unlock-password"|"access-level","level":n,"title":"Password","prompt":"","userIdRequired":b,"defaultUserId":null,"mode":"book"|"select","unlock":b,"login":b,"logoutAfter":b,"actions":[...],"golden":"..."}`.
