+3. Page:
+   - `dialog-bridge.js` `needsAuth()` (:436-439) fires on a closing action when `request.auth.required && !authVerified`.
+   - `openAuth` (:469-477) opens the `#dialogAuth` iframe `page/Alert.Password.html` (login-page.js).
+   - `HT_DIALOG_AUTH_SUBMIT` goes to `submitAuth` (:486-521), which builds Dialog-auth-verify:
+     `{schemaVersion:"1.0.0",channel:"dialog-auth",seq,authId,state:"pending",target:{channel,requestId},pendingAction:{name,code,pressedButton},credentials:{userId,password}}`.
+   - `HTDialogHost.verifyAuth` (`ht9045_dialog_host.js:298-326`) sends WS **`dialog.auth`** (tag = authId, value = that JSON as a string) through `HT9045Recipe.dialogAuth` (`ht9045_recipe_client.js:666`). It blanks `credentials.password` right after.
+   - Cancel: `sendAuthCancel` (:327-339) sends `{... "cancelled":true}` (Q45-4 = A: blank = wrong).
+4. C++:
+   - Blocking note wait: else-chain `tools/wb_serve.cpp:671` calls `W906_NoteAuthVerify(authId, value, qid, true, &reply)`.
+   - Notices: main loop `:4889-4904` (`blocking=false`, `currentId` = current notice).
+   - The op token is not required for `dialog.auth` (`WebBridge/WebBridgeServer.cpp:1448`).
+   - **The compare** happens inside `W906_NoteAuthVerify` (WebLogin.cpp:2509-2634): `Press` runs `DoUnlockPassword` (:2177) and `DoPassword` (:2201), which call `WebLogin_BookCompare` (St02 :383) or `stOperatorClick` (:167). It is not `W906_Reauth`.
+   - Reply JSON (no password): `{schemaVersion,channel:"dialog-auth",authId,state:"completed",accepted,accessLevel,userId:null,message,verifiedAt:null,error:null,requestId,action,pressedButton,cancelled,asked,unlockAsked,stage,mode,required,levelBefore,level,loggedOut,alarm?,reason,golden,login}`.
+5. One-shot pass. On accept, the note stores `passValid/passK/passPressed`. The answer right after it uses the pass up: `W906_NoteAuthAnswerGate` (wb_serve.cpp:585, modal.answer / dialog.response) or `W906_NoteAuthNoticeGate` (:4889, dialog.notifyAck). A panel key is gated by `W906_NoteAuthIoGate` (:684). If golden would ask and there is no pass, the answer is refused with `auth-required`.
