+**Generic pieces, reusable as they are:**
+- the WS command name `dialog.auth` and its token exemption;
+- `HT9045Recipe.dialogAuth`;
+- the Dialog-auth-verify wrapper shape;
+- `Alert.Password.html` + `login-page.js`. login-page.js:26-27 already does `var employee = auth.kind === 'employee-id'; show($('Label5'), employee); show($('Label6'), employee);`;
